      "content": "That's a very strong opening. Can you expand on that? Specifically, how can I frame the 'rigid dogmas' of that group so that they don't just sound like a caricature, but rather like something that feels authentically, dangerously real in the context of the book? I want to make sure the reader feels the weight of their error.",
